# Accelerometer calibration (the six-pose), for the Lucid H7's two IMUs
#
# What a successful accel cal writes, read off AP_InertialSensor::_acal_save_calibrations()
# (ArduPilot master): per accel, INS_ACCnOFFS, INS_ACCnSCAL, INS_ACCn_CALTEMP and the
# device id; and, with the trim option at its default, AHRS_TRIM from the level pose.
#
# INS_ACC_ID / INS_ACC2_ID are deliberately NOT pinned, for the same reason COMPASS_DEV_ID
# is not in gps-compass.param: the cal saves the id of the part detected on that boot. They
# read 3408138 / 3408162 in every export from 2026-08-02 to 2026-10-13, so the parts these
# numbers belong to are the parts on the board now.
#
# provenance: 3856c84 2026-09-23, the last export taken before the parameter store was
# wiped (612c687 "Params after reset" zeroed all of these, and b17c226 2026-10-13 restored
# the compass but not these). Since then the FC has refused to arm with
# "PreArm: 3D Accel calibration needed". These values are ahead of the current export on
# purpose; re-apply and re-export to bring them level, or supersede them with a fresh cal.
INS_ACCOFFS_X,-0.02739513
INS_ACCOFFS_Y,0.02238205
INS_ACCOFFS_Z,0.03065747
INS_ACCSCAL_X,0.998598
INS_ACCSCAL_Y,1
INS_ACCSCAL_Z,1.001394
INS_ACC1_CALTEMP,33.21256
INS_ACC2OFFS_X,-0.001977467
INS_ACC2OFFS_Y,0.03473198
INS_ACC2OFFS_Z,-0.03578397
INS_ACC2SCAL_X,0.9977936
INS_ACC2SCAL_Y,0.99949
INS_ACC2SCAL_Z,1.000427
INS_ACC2_CALTEMP,32.72947
AHRS_TRIM_X,0.004168944
AHRS_TRIM_Y,0.001064814
AHRS_TRIM_Z,0
